                            RAT STRIKE
|YK0================================================================|YKB

'Even the smallest blow can prove effective.' |WK0- |RKBMaster La deh
|YK0
A Monk in the Rat form can make a rapid darting blow at a foe
dealing a quick effective blow to the throat which may render
the target speechless.

|MK0This is a Disciple rank power.|YK0

